          <tr><td><strong>Reserve Pool</strong></td><td>Named sub-account within a corridor holding pledged central bank funds. Three pools per corridor.</td><td>BCEAO-XOF-RESERVE-01</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Lock</strong></td><td>Immutable ledger entry reserving a specific amount from a reserve pool for a defined duration</td><td>50,000 XOF locked for 24h</td></tr>
